// A wait longer than a timer can hold (2^31 ms, about 25 days) is armed in pieces: a delay that
// `setTimeout` reads as a 32-bit number would fire at once, and the page would tick every
// millisecond for the whole wait.
// virtual-ms: 3000000000
// web-max-ticks: 5
fn main() {
    wait(3000000.0)
    print("done")
}

// expect: done
